<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 Pity</book>
  <para style="h">1 Pity</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Pity</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pity</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Pity</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zisu Krista lyuhchâpa Pity ta Pawntu, Kalatia, Kâpadôkia, Asia nata Bithunia râhzy liata paipatlapa ta a ypa atlyhpa sahlao,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paw Khazohpa pahno chhieliepa hawhta atlyhpazy, Zisu Krista rei a ngiah awpa nata a thisaih ta thia awpa ta Thlahpa ta pathaisapazy ei cha naoh ei. Nama chô liata ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna papôhsapa ta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eima Beipa Zisu Krista Khazohpa nata Paw cha reithaipa ta y mawh sy! Ano cha zawngiahna rônah ngaitapa a hneipa a châpa hawhta, athihpa hry tawhta Zisu Krista thyuheihna zawhzi ta hnabeiseihna hrohpa hnei awpa ta miah papihpathisa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ryuto rao thei leipa, apuapa a hlao leipa nata lo beih leipa vârâh liata a cha sopa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Daihti hnôhchaipa liata palâhâh awpa ta a mâ chiehpa ta a ypa ngiapâna vâta pachhana nama hmô thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa hmotaotheina ta vaipa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha hnabeiseihna liata thata a ly ei chi ta, pasiana to ta tahmâ buakha chhôh pachârôhpa ta nama y chy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatanachata pasiapa ta a ypa namâ ngiapâna cha, mei ta pasiapa ngôh hlâta sôh viapa ngiapâna hmeiseihpa a châzie a lâ aw ta, Zisu Krista â vaw luah tita reithaina nata palyupalihna nata rônahna zy nama to aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Krista cha nama hmô leipa chhao ta a kyh pachâ ei chi ta, tahmâ hmô hra vei u la, a ngiapâ ei chi ta, pakah ta rei khai thei leipa alyna nata rônahna ta biepa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />namâ ngiapâna chhâpa nama thlahpa pachhana cha nama hmô haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha pachhana kyh cha, nama chô liata ngiachhiena a vaw tlô awpa a chhochhielietuhpa hrohsopazy ta pakhâta ta tluapa ta a laichadai ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />âmo liata a ypa Krista Thlahpa ta Krista pasa tao awpa nata cha khai tawhta palyupalihna a vaw pazi awpazy kyh ama rei chhielie nona khata, khati ta ma vaw tlô aw ta, kheihawh ta a vaw tlô awpa ma a châ tahpa zy amâ laichadai tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cha biezy cha hrohsopazy ta ama rei nota, âmosasyh â chakaopa châ leipa ei ta, nâmo châ chakaopa ama châzie ama hnohta pahnosapa ama châ. Cha hmozy cha vârâh tawhta tuapa Thlahpa Pathaihpa baona ta thâtihpha châ chhotuhpazy ta tahmâ nota ama cha chhopa hmozy he a châ. Cha hmozy cha vâlyuhchâpazy chhao ta hmô awpa ama khoh kaw tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chavâta nama palôh chai a saihpa ta a hrohrua u la, Zisu Krista â vaw luah tita ngiachhiena a cha vaw phaopa awpa ei cha khâchâ hnabeiseihpa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saw phapazy hawhta y u la, kha hlâta nama pahno lei nota nama aohraohnazy hawh khata y khao khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Châ awtuhpa ei a pathaihpa hawhta, nâmo chhao nama yzie zydua liata pathaihpa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei ei pathaihpa hawhta, nâmo chhao nama pathaih awpa a châ,” tahpa ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khokhei viapa hnei leipa ta, chyhsa to ama hmotaopa chyu hawhta pachiatuhpa cha Paw hawhta nama pado khiahta cha, khizaw liata nama y chhôh cha khitlyhpa hawhta y u la, Paw Khazohpa cha chiza muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Châ pathlatuhpazy tawhta nama to pachhuahpa nama yzie hraoleipa tawhta a rao theipa tâkâ nata ngôh ta chatlaipa châ leipa ei chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mietakutaw seina hnei leipa nata apuapa a bai leipa thisaih hawhta Krista thisaih sôhpa ta chatlaipa nama châpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ano cha leilô y hlâ tawhta pahno chhieliepa châ ta, nâmo châ deikua ta cha daihti hnôhchaipazy liata palâhâhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khazohpa ta Krista cha athihpa hry tawhta pathyupa ta rônahna patosa ta, Krista zawhzi ta Khazohpa ngiapâtuhpazy nama vaw châ haw. Chatanachata namâ ngiapâna nata hnabeiseihna cha Khazohpa liata a y thlâh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unawhzy kyhpachâna hmeiseihpa hnei awpa ta biehmeiseihpa zyh ei chi ta, nama thlahpa nama pathaisa ha tawhta cha, palôh pathaihpa nata hmeiseihpa ta kyh a pachâ raihrie muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chi rao theipa liata pihpathipa châ leipa ei chi ta, chi rao thei leipa, Khazohpa bie hroh thlâhpa nata a y thlâh hapa liata a pihpathipazy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Chyhsa zydua sibiepa hawhta châ ei ta, Ama rônahna zydua chhao, Sibiepa paw hawh dei a châ. Sibiepa cha uah ta, Pawpi chhao a lo tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abeipa bie deikua cha, Chhâzaw ta a y thlâh ha aw.” Cha bie cha thâtihpha ama cha chhopa cha a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta ahaona, haidihaiduana, phapakheina, hiatliana nata reipachhiena zydua bâhsai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hawsaih pih thiehpazy hawhta, thlahpa sâhpiti patapa vâ u la, chatanachata nama pachhana liata nama laiseih lymâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abeipa phana nama padi ha hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ano cha chyhsazy kho leipa châ ta, Khazohpa mohmô liata deikua cha, atlyhpa nata sôh ngaitapa alô hrohpa a châ. Abeipa nama pangai hapa vâta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zisu Krista zawhzi ta Khazohpa a pyh tlâhpa thlahpa atheihna hlâtuhpa theihthai pathaihpazy châ awpa ta, alô hrohpa hawhta paduapa thlahpa o nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chavâta Biehrai liata, “Moh teh u, Zaio liata alô paryh na ta, Ano cha a ki liata alô sôhpa nata atlyhpa châ ta; Ahy rai ano a ngiapâpa cha, Maophyuh aw vei,” tahpa ta ropa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta Krista cha nâmo, ngiapâtuhpazy châta hmo sôh ngaitapa châ ta, ngiapâleipazy châta deikua cha, “O satuhpazy kho leipa alô cha, A ki liata alô phahnai chaipa a vaw châ haw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Achapiana lô vaw châ ta, Moleina lôpanô a vaw châ haw.” Bie ama zyh leipa vâta a chapia ei ta, cha hawhta y awpa ta raopa rai ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nâmo deikua la, zohna tawhta puapa ta khaihna noâhpa liata a ngia awpa ta châ awtuhpa ei phana cha nama phuah thei nawpa ta, phopi atlyhpa, abei chi theihthaipa, phopi pathaihpa, Khazohpa ryuto phopi nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hlâno ta cha phopi châ leipa ei chi ta, tahmâ deikua cha Khazohpa phopi nama châ haw. Hlâno ta cha zawngiahna hmô leipa ei chi ta, tahmâ deikua cha zawngiahna nama hmô haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, khichhaipa nata khitlyhpa nama châpa vâta, thlahpa a dyuhtuhpa sapa aohraohnazy bâhsai awpa ta ei châ haw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zenitaizy hry liata zachhihpa ta y teh u. Chatanachata moleina hmo a taopazy hawhta ama cha reipachhiepa chhao ta, nama hmo pha taopazy hmô aw ei ta, Khazohpa ta miah a vaw tly noh ta ano cha ama palyupalih thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ryureih awpa ta raopazy cha, Abeipa vâta ama rei a ngiah teh u. Biehnei chaipa bei rai châ sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />moleina hmo a taopazy hrie awpa nata hmo pha a taopazy palyupalih awpa ta bei ta a tuapa râhvaotuhpa rai châ sala, ryureituhpazy rei a ngiah khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha cha Khazohpa khozie châ ta, ahrupazy ta pahno leina vâta bie ama reipazy cha, nama hmo pha taopa ta nama chalihsa thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khotalaipa châ ei chi ta, châhrasala nama khotalaina cha moleina khu nawpa ta nama hmâ awpa châ leipa ta, Khazohpa chakaotuhpazy hawhta tlao nama y awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua za u la, unawhzy kyhpachâ u la, Khazohpa chi u la, abei cha za teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sei saih u, kyh to liata nama zibeipazy rei a ngiah teh u. Zibeipa phapa nata nônaipazy dei châ leipa ta, zibeipa nôchhiepazy rei chhao namâ ngiah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chyhsa ta Khazohpa a pachâpa vâta pasa tao lei awpa taopa ta, pachârôhna a tao hualuapa cha, palyupalihna a to tlâh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuna pasataona namâ tyh tita, tiama kawpa ta dao thei hra u la, moleina hmo nama taopa vâta namâ tyhpa a châ khiahta cha, khâpa phahnaina a hnei? Hmo pha taopa vâta pasa tao ei chi ta, tiama kawpa ta nama dao thei khiahta deikua cha, cha cha Khazohpa hmiakô liata palyupalihna a to tlâh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Krista kha nâmo châta pasa a taopa vâta, nâmo chhao pasa tao awpa ta awpa châ ei chi ta, a pheihnie nama pazi thei nawpa ta a mopâ awpa a cha sopa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ano cha hmo a parao beih leipa, a pakah liata haidihaiduana a y leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Reipachhiepa ta a y nota, reipachhie hri leipa ta, pasa taopa ta a y nota, pachhipary hra vei. Â dopa ta pachiatuhpa hnohta tlao â hlâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moleina thisaipa ta siana lâta eima hroh thei nawpa ta, eima moleinazy cha ano ta a pôhpa tlai ta tho liata phaoh ta, Krista hmahzy ta patlâhpa ta nama y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mietakuzy hawhta lâpi pavia ei chi ta, tahmâ deikua cha nama thlahpa Chhituhpa nata Mietaku Vaituhpa lâ nama kua ha hih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata nâmo, lapinô saih u, nama vahpazy rei a ngiah teh u. Chatanachata Khazohpa bie a zyh leipa vahpazy ama y khiahta cha, bie ta chho cheingei hlei leipa chhao ta, ama lapinôzy hrozie ta pahniepa ta ama y thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nama zachhihna nata pathaihna hro nama vahpazy ta ama hmô tita, âmo cha nama pahnie thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namâ tobina cha khôtho lâ atobina, sâ phiehpa, ngôh ta a tobipa, chysia ta a tobipa zy châ leipa sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chhôh lâta atobina, chhithaina a tleih beih leipa, nônaina nata achalihna palôh ta tlao a tobipa châ mawh sy. Cha cha Khazohpa mohmô ta a sôh ngaita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata hlâno ta chanô pathaihpa, Khazohpa ngiapâtuhpazy chhao khata, ama vahpazy rei a ngiahpa ta, chhôh lâta atobina ta amâ vaw tobi tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sârâ chhao khata Abarahâ cha ei zibeipa tahpa ta aw ta, a rei â ngiahpa kha. Hmo pha nama tao khiahta cha, khâpa hmah chi leipa aw ei chi ta, chatanachata Sârâ sawzy nama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, nâmo, vahpa saih u, chanô cha hmobaoh rao nao viapa a châ hleikhô ta, nama lapinôzy cha ngiachhiena hro liata ryu nama to lâhpazy ama châpa vâta, nama thlahchhânazy pakhâpa ta a y lei nawpa ta, nama lapinôzy palyupalih u la, pahnothai kawpa ta pahrâ khoh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chhâ chaina ta cha, nama zydua ta palôh miakha phaohpa ta y u la, tha a pasa raihrie teh u. Unawh hawhta kyh a pachâ u la, a ngiachhie raihriepa ta, areisipa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moleina cha moleina ta viarithô leipa u la, reipachhiena chhao reipachhiena ta viarithô hra leipa u la, byhnâ tlao awpa teh u. Cha hawhta taopa ta byhnâ to awpa ta awpa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kyhpachâna hro tlaichhai ta, Noh pha a hmô khohpa cha, Moleina liata a paleih vaih sala, Dôveina liata a hmao vaih mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moleina a heihsai sala, Hmo pha tao mawh sy; Thlalôhna tlua sala, A chadai lymâ mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abeipa mo cha mosiapazy chô liata y ta, Ama thlahchhâna lâ nah a pachôh tyh. Moleipazy deikua cha, Abeipa hmia ta â dyuh tyh ei.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmo pha taona liata phahnai namâ ngiah khiahta cha, ahy châ parao thei aw ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siana vâta pasa a taopa nama châ khiahta cha, vânoh nama to aw. Ama cha pachhiparyna chi leipa u la, nôpopa ta y hra khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nama palôh liata deikua cha, Krista cha Abeipa ta hnei u la, hnabeiseihna nama hneina chhâpa châ hiahripa maih a chhy awpa ta khatino rai ta a mâ chiehpa ta y teh u. Cha hawhta nama tao tita deikua, nônaina, zana nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chhie nata pha pahnona pathaihpa hmâpa ta nama tao awpa a châ. Chatanachata Krista liata nama hrozie phapa a reipachhie tyhpazy cha maophyuhpa ta ama y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moleina hmo taopa vâta pasa taopa hlâta cha, Khazohpa khozie a châ khiahta cha, hmo pha taopa vâta pasa taopa a pha via.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khazohpa lâ miah â chhi thei nawpa ta, Krista cha moleinazy châta chhâzaw châta ei kha thi ta, mosiapa cha moleipa vyuhpa ta thi ta, sapa liata thiepa ta y ta, thlahpa liata deikua pahropa ta a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cha hawhta a thina liana chata patâhna o liata thlahpa a ypazy hnohta bie chho ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />âmo cha Nôah hro nota balyh tao chhôh zydua Khazohpa ta dao thei ngaitapa ta a hâ chhôh ta reingiahleipa thlahpazy kha ama châ. Balyh liana cha chyhsa chyhta, pacharie deita, ti tawhta ta pachhapa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha taozie nata a lyupa bâtina ta nâmo chhao tahmâ pachhapa nama châ. Pôhpa tawhta apuapa pathaipa hawhta châ leipa ta, chhie nata pha pahnona pathaihpa hmâpa ta Khazohpa nama padopa vâta, Zisu Krista thyuheihna zawhzi ta pachhapazy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zisu Krista cha vârâh lâ kiah ta, Khazohpa chachâh lâta y ta, vâlyuhchâpazy, biehneinazy nata hmotaotheinazy cha ano rei sai ta y awpa ta taopa ama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Krista cha sapa ta pasa a taopa a châpa vâta, nâmo chhao, cha hawhpa pachâna chata a tobi hra teh u. Sapa ta pasa a tao hapa cha moleina a bâhsaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chatanachata sapa ta nama hro chhôh zydua chyhsapa aohraohnazy liata hroh khao leipa aw ei chi ta, Khazohpa khozie hawhta nama hroh thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zenitaizy khopa taopa ta, parâna, aohraohna, paripangana, a hlao ta apatlana, sahma do pahmaohna nata nothlahpa achhyna pasichhihpa zy liata nama vaw tlaih tyhpa kha â daih ha bâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha kyh liata phasa ngaitapa ta ama y tyhpa liata namâ hlao khao leipa ama noâh kaw ta, ama cha reipachhie tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahrohpa nata athihpa pachia awpa ta a mâ chiehpa ta a y thlâh hapa hnohta ama thâtih âmo tlai ta amâ reih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha vâna chata athihpa hnoh chhao ta thâtihpha chhopa a châ. Sapa ta a ypa chyhsazy hawhta pachiapa ama châpa chhao ta, Khazohpa hawhta thlahpa ta ama hroh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmo zydua chhâna â hnia haw. Chavâta thlah nama chhâ thei nawpa ta palôh pasohpa nata a sohsi ngaitapa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kyhpachâna ta moleina hluhpi khu ta, chavâta ato zydua hlâta kyhpachâna pachâ peimawh viapa ta, palôh hmeiseihpa ta kyh khâ a pachâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pasô raihrie u la, paphôh khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chyhsa to hmopiepa to chyu ei chi ta, Khazohpa ngiachhiena nanopa nama topazy a châpa pahnopa ta, hmopiepa nama topazy cha a chakao raihrie nawpa châta hmâh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahy rai bie a reihpa maih Khazohpa bie hawhta reih sala, a chakaopa maih Khazohpa ta thatlôna a piepa lymâ hawhta chakao mawh sy. Chatanachata Zisu Krista vâta Khazohpa cha kyh to liata palyupalihpa ta a y thei aw. Rônahna nata hmotaotheina cha chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta ano eih châ tlôh ta. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kho ngaitapa saih u, pasiana ru ngaitapa a tyhpa ta pasa nama tao tita, nama chô liata hmo a tlôpa cha noâh tah khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Krista rônahna â vaw luah tita, thaphapa ta namâ ly thei nawpa ta, Krista pasataona a hlykheituhpazy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista moh vâta pasipasawhpa nama châ khiahta cha, rônahna Thlahpa nata Khazohpa Thlahpa cha nama chô liata y ta, chavâta nama nohlao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lianycheina vâta tlyma, paruna vâta tlyma, paraona vâta tlyma, hohiahna vâta tlyma deikua cha, nama hry liata ahy hmah pasa tao khah sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Krizyhpa a châpa vâta pasa a taopa cha, a noza leipa sala, Krista moh ta Khazohpa tlao palyupalih mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachiana cha Khazohpa chhôhkhazy liata pathao a daih ha ta, keimo lia hmahta pachiana a pathao khiahta cha, Khazohpa thâtihpha bie a zyh leipazy chhâna awpa chhochhi cha kheihta ma a châ aw tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mosiapa hmahta pachha lyliapa a châ khiahta cha, Khazohpa a uasa leipa nata moleipa chhochhi cha, Kheihta rimâ ma ama châ aw tly?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa khozie hawhta pasa a taopazy cha, hmo pha taona chôta, Taotuhpa ngâchhihpa liata ama thlahpa pavaosa mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nama hry liata Awnanopa chhituhpazy kha, kei, nama chhituh heihpa, Krista pasa taonazy a pahnotuhpa nata rônahna a vaw luah awpa a to hra awpa heta ei cha pasyu ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nama hry liata Khazohpa mietaku zaw kha vaih u la, mohôh teh u. Tao awpa a châpa vâta tao leipa ta, Khazohpa bie hawhta byuh ngaitapa ta taopa châ mawh sy. Avyuhna puapa khopa vâta châ leipa sala, chakaona rai hria khohpa vâta châ mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama mohôhpa mietakuzy chô liata a pabeisa leipa u la, mietaku zaw châta a mopâ tlâhpa ta tlao y muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chatanachata Mietaku Vaituhpa Beichaipa â vaw luah tita, rônahna beilakho rao thei leipa nama hmô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata nâmo, hawti viapazy saih u, uhthei viapazy liata a ngiarih teh u. Nama zydua ta areisina chysia ta a tobi u la, a chakao raihrie teh u. “Khazohpa ta apalaipazy a dyuh ta, areisipazy deikua cha a ngiachhie tyh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa ku thatlôpa ry liata a panawh teh u. Chatanachata a daihtita liata a cha palyupalih aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khazohpa ta cha pachâ ngaita ei ta, chavâta nama nôpona zydua a chô liata pahnieh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Palôh pasohpa ta y u la, a hrohrua teh u. Nama khakhaipa ahripa cha chakeibarôhneipa a rôhpa hawhta a rôh ta, a nie thei awpa tluapa ta â khie tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khizaw zydua liata nama unawhzy chô liata chhao, cha hawhta pasataona cha a tlô hra tahpa pahnopa ta, ngiapâna liata â ipa ta y u la, ahripa a dyuh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngiachhiena zydua Khazohpa, a chhâzaw rônahna to awpa ta Krista liata châ awtuhpa ei chata, bohpi leipa pasa nama tao khai tawhta, cha paduapathi aw ei ta, cha pa-ipa ta tha cha patlô aw ei ta, a cha padua aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmotaotheina cha a hnohta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unawh ngâchhihpa ta ei pachâpa Silvanâ baona ta nâmo lâ pasyuna châ chyuta vaw roh na ta, cha cha Khazohpa ngiachhiena hmeiseihpa a châ tahpa ei reih. Cha liana chata â ipa ta a duah muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babylaw khih liata a ypa, nâmo hawhta atlyhpa chanô ta a châ naoh ei. Cha hawhna chata ei sawchapawpa Mâka chhao ta a châ naoh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kyhpachâna ta a pahnâpa ta a naoh raihrie teh u. Krista liata a ypa nama zydua hnohta thlalôhna y mawh sy.
  </para>
</usx>
